# 🔥 Why This App?

Because almost every FLAC→ALAC converter is either:

❌ command-line only
❌ old & ugly
❌ converts one file at a time
❌ doesn’t preserve album art
❌ doesn’t support multi-threading
❌ doesn’t skip already-converted files

**This tool fixes all of that.**
Fast, beautiful, and ridiculously easy to use.

